<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Eclipse menus.

     item:        one command.  `icon` names a file under resources/icons (without .svg).  `slot` is called on the first of the `responder`s that has it.
                  responder names: sceneUI (the main window), cameraView, timelineView,
                  paletteView, xsheetView, Node View, and firstResponder (the view that has the keyboard focus).
                  A slot taking (bool) receives the checked state of a checkable item; one
                  taking (QString) or (int) receives `itemParameter`.
                  The same id used in several places is the same command.
     submenu:     inserts the top-level menu with that id.
     placeholder: a menu filled by the program: `aboutToShowSlot` is called each time it opens. -->
